{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Velocity</strong> is a momentum-based precision platformer about climbing from the depths of the world into the vastness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in the planet\u2019s fiery core and rise through forests, cliffs, and clouds \u2014 mastering launch-and-bounce controls that demand patience, timing, and focus. Every stage is handcrafted to test precision and persistence, with no shortcuts or cheats. Only skill will carry you upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey through layers of the world</strong> \u2014 from molten caverns to sky-high clouds and beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, skill-based controls</strong> where every launch and rebound matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, atmospheric presentation</strong> with arcade-inspired music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-friendly design</strong> for those who want to push their limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb higher. Fall harder. Rise again. How far will your determination take you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2505630?t=1760759260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2505630?t=1760759260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505630/95ac17acd55de1fd2ed31dd0fe547470a84b1c40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760759260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505630/95ac17acd55de1fd2ed31dd0fe547470a84b1c40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760759260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Velocit